            <fullName>Create_Quote_Request_179jV000000pdk8</fullName>
            <description>Registers a quote request for the sales team for one product and a quantity, for the customer number the customer gave. Uses the same product search as the product specifications (product code, product name, Dutch or English product type). Returns quoteRequestCreated, the quote request number (QR-...), the product name, the matching products if several match, and a message for the customer. If an open quote request already exists for the same product, returns that number instead of creating a new one. Never returns or sets prices.</description>
