        <localActions>
            <fullName>Get_Product_Specs_179jV000000pdk7</fullName>
            <description>Looks up the technical specifications of one active Delta product by product name, part of a name, or product code (for example DP-200 or DIS-VLV-BS-DN25). Returns productFound, the specification values (maximum pressure in bar, temperature range in degrees Celsius, connection size, material) and the datasheet text. If several products match, returns matchCount and matchingProducts instead. Never returns prices or stock. Call this action for every product question, also when the same or a similar product was asked about earlier in the conversation: a different wording can give a different result, and earlier results may be outdated. Pass the customer&apos;s words as given, in Dutch or English: Dutch product types also work (for example &quot;kogelafsluiter DN25&quot; or &quot;circulatiepomp DP-200&quot;).</description>
            <developerName>Get_Product_Specs_179jV000000pdk7</developerName>
